{"id":"58c35051f3ea09e6","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md","title":"谓词的材料充分性","display":"df-adequacy-conditions-truth — 谓词的材料充分性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth","aliases":["91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth","91-df-predicate-material-adequacy"],"display":"df-adequacy-conditions-truth — 谓词的材料充分性","depends_on":["[[91-df-T-schema]]","[[91-df-adequacy-conditions]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth</span><span>91-df-predicate-material-adequacy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-adequacy-conditions-truth — 谓词的材料充分性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" href=\"?note=ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" title=\"91-df-T-schema\">91-df-T-schema</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"83345981d6558f8e\" href=\"?note=83345981d6558f8e\" title=\"91-df-adequacy-conditions\">91-df-adequacy-conditions</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-adequacy-conditions-truth-—-谓词的材料充分性-$\\mathrm{Adeq}_T$\">df-adequacy-conditions-truth — 谓词的材料充分性 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Adeq}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Adeq}_T\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathcal T_T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> (含真理谓词的理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T}^{1}\">\\(T\\in\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T}^{1}\\)</span> (扩展语言的一元谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> (T-双条件的实例域)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner}:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\n\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner}:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\n\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> (句子编码的数字名)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adequacy\\text{-}conditions\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Adeq}_T(T,\\mathcal T_T,\\mathcal D)\n\\coloneqq\nT\\in\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T}^{1}\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathcal D\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adequacy\\text{-}conditions\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Adeq}_T(T,\\mathcal T_T,\\mathcal D)\n\\coloneqq\nT\\in\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T}^{1}\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathcal D\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>必须同时标出理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_T\">\\(\\mathcal T_T\\)</span> 与实例域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal D\\)</span>。\n“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 是一个合式的一元谓词”只是形式正确性；真正的材料充分性是理论\n对域内每个句子证明正确双条件。</p>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathcal D=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> 时，TB、UTB、\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span> 以及标准 KF 都可满足相应的基础语言材料充分性。\n这不表示它们算术等强，也不表示都保守。</p>\n<p>不可定义性是另一个元定理：标准算术真句集不能由单个\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\)</span> 公式定义。它不是材料充分性的一个额外合取项。\n同样，FS 的捕获/释放规则不能被误写成对全部自指句子的对象语言\n全 T-schema；在经典逻辑下取\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathcal D=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> 会触发说谎者矛盾。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-adequacy-conditions-truth-—-谓词的材料充分性-$\\mathrm{Adeq}_T$","text":"df-adequacy-conditions-truth — 谓词的材料充分性 $\\mathrm{Adeq}_T$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-T-schema","status":"resolved","id":"ba367ff1b4bb3da3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-T-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-adequacy-conditions","status":"resolved","id":"83345981d6558f8e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-adequacy-conditions]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Adeq}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\in\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T}^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline{\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner}:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\n\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adequacy\\text{-}conditions\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Adeq}_T(T,\\mathcal T_T,\\mathcal D)\n\\coloneqq\nT\\in\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T}^{1}\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathcal D\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}"